        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alex is supposed to just meet his girlfriend at a club. An ordinary evening, an ordinary city, an important meeting with people who can change his future. But the road to the club turns into a real nightmare. Every step takes him not closer to the goal, but deeper into a labyrinth of distorted streets, empty corridors and strange spaces, where the boundaries between reality and delirium are blurred. Will Alex be able to get to the club? Or is the club just another illusion? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological horror with an emphasis on atmosphere and tension. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimum interface, maximum immersion in a dark story. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No riddles, only a plot </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character can climb and pee in the toilet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong> make me insane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game works on Steam Deck (I adjusted the screen resolution for it, but I need to adjust the controls)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036740/extras/18d2bd5ff64e4b2b1d92c7ed15219e8a.poster.avif?t=1761566608\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036740/extras/18d2bd5ff64e4b2b1d92c7ed15219e8a.webm?t=1761566608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036740/extras/18d2bd5ff64e4b2b1d92c7ed15219e8a.mp4?t=1761566608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu